{"mode": "live", "backend": "cli", "model": "sonnet", "seconds": 49.2, "shop": "小滿便當（模擬店家）", "steps": [{"i": 1, "thought": "剛開始，先列出資料夾裡有哪些檔案，才知道有哪些對帳單與備註。", "tool": "list_files", "args": {}, "result": {"files": ["A_ads.csv", "A_items.csv", "A_orders.csv", "B_ads.csv", "B_items.csv", "B_orders.csv", "contract.json", "menu_costs.csv", "owner_note.txt", "platform_menu.csv", "pos_direct.csv", "promos.csv"]}, "t": 3.1}, {"i": 2, "thought": "先讀老闆備註和各對帳單的表頭，了解欄位與限制。", "tool": "read_file", "args": {"names": ["owner_note.txt", "A_orders.csv", "A_items.csv", "A_ads.csv", "B_orders.csv", "B_items.csv", "B_ads.csv"], "max_lines": 4}, "result": {"owner_note.txt": {"total_lines": 4, "head": ["老闆備註：", "1. 雞腿便當是我們的招牌，不能下架，要漲的話最多漲 10 元。", "2. 平台 A 的「滿 199 折 40（店家全額負擔）」（活動代碼 A-PROMO3）是跟業務簽好的，這個月還不能退。", "3. 其他品項可以調，但單一品項不要一次漲超過兩成，客人會嚇到。"]}, "A_orders.csv": {"total_lines": 1558, "head": ["訂單編號,訂單日期,商品小計,店家負擔折扣,平台負擔折扣,活動代碼,佣金,佣金營業稅,廣告活動,調整金額,調整說明品項,撥款金額", "A99-00001,2026-10-22,170,5,0,A-PROMO2,50,2,,0,,113", "A99-00002,2026-10-07,200,40,0,A-PROMO3,48,2,,0,,110", "A99-00003,2026-10-31,195,0,0,,58,3,,0,,134"]}, "A_items.csv": {"total_lines": 3107, "head": ["訂單編號,品項,數量,單價", "A99-00001,素食便當,1,105", "A99-00001,貢丸湯,1,40", "A99-00001,古早味紅茶,1,25"]}, "A_ads.csv": {"total_lines": 63, "head": ["日期,廣告活動,花費", "2026-10-01,A-AD1,38", "2026-10-02,A-AD1,38", "2026-10-03,A-AD1,38"]}, "B_orders.csv": {"total_lines": 834, "head": ["order_id,order_date,sales_incl_tax,promo_merchant_funded,promo_platform_funded,promo_code,marketplace_fee,marketplace_fee_tax,ad_campaign,order_error_adjustment,error_item,total_payout", "B99-01223,10/28/2026,135,0,0,,-44,-2,,0,,89", "B99-01224,10/28/2026,190,0,0,,-62,-3,,0,,125", "B99-01225,10/23/2026,290,-40,0,B-PROMO1,-94,-5,,0,,151"]}, "B_items.csv": {"total_lines": 1656, "head": ["order_id,item_name,quantity,price", "B99-01223,排骨便當,1,135", "B99-01224,素食便當,1,110", "B99-01224,燙青菜,1,50"]}, "B_ads.csv": {"total_lines": 32, "head": ["date,campaign_name,ad_spend", "10/01/2026,B-AD1,-171", "10/02/2026,B-AD1,-171", "10/03/2026,B-AD1,-171"]}}, "t": 6.0}, {"i": 3, "thought": "先處理平台 A：欄位名稱很直白，照表頭對應後提交 ingest，用撥款金額重算來檢查對不對。", "tool": "ingest", "args": {"platform": "A", "mapping": {"orders": {"order_id": "訂單編號", "date": "訂單日期", "subtotal": "商品小計", "merchant_discount": "店家負擔折扣", "platform_discount": "平台負擔折扣", "promo_id": "活動代碼", "commission": "佣金", "commission_tax": "佣金營業稅", "ad_campaign": "廣告活動", "adjustment": "調整金額", "refund_item": "調整說明品項", "payout": "撥款金額"}, "lines": {"order_id": "訂單編號", "item": "品項", "qty": "數量", "unit_price": "單價"}, "ads": {"date": "日期", "campaign": "廣告活動", "spend": "花費"}}}, "result": {"platform": "A", "ok": true, "errors": [], "orders": 1557, "payout_total": 181383, "ad_spend_total": 1594, "payout_match": 1.0, "lines_match": 1.0, "commission_match": 1.0, "effective_rate": 0.3004, "contract_rate": 0.3, "unknown_items": []}, "t": 11.9}, {"i": 4, "thought": "平台 A 已通過檢查。接著提交平台 B 的欄位對應，B 的折扣、佣金、廣告費是負數，先照欄位意思對應，看檢查結果。", "tool": "ingest", "args": {"platform": "B", "mapping": {"orders": {"order_id": "order_id", "date": "order_date", "subtotal": "sales_incl_tax", "merchant_discount": "promo_merchant_funded", "platform_discount": "promo_platform_funded", "promo_id": "promo_code", "commission": "marketplace_fee", "commission_tax": "marketplace_fee_tax", "ad_campaign": "ad_campaign", "adjustment": "order_error_adjustment", "refund_item": "error_item", "payout": "total_payout"}, "lines": {"order_id": "order_id", "item": "item_name", "qty": "quantity", "unit_price": "price"}, "ads": {"date": "date", "campaign": "campaign_name", "spend": "ad_spend"}}}, "result": {"platform": "B", "ok": true, "errors": [], "orders": 833, "payout_total": 99466, "ad_spend_total": 5304, "payout_match": 1.0, "lines_match": 1.0, "commission_match": 1.0, "effective_rate": 0.3248, "contract_rate": 0.325, "unknown_items": []}, "t": 17.3}, {"i": 5, "thought": "兩個平台對帳單都通過了，接著把老闆的口語限制轉成結構化限制：雞腿便當不能下架且最多漲10元、A-PROMO3不能退、單品最多漲兩成。", "tool": "set_constraints", "args": {"protected_items": ["雞腿便當"], "max_raise": {"雞腿便當": 10}, "max_raise_pct": 0.2, "locked_promos": ["A-PROMO3"]}, "result": {"constraints": {"protected_items": ["雞腿便當"], "max_raise": {"雞腿便當": 10}, "max_raise_pct": 0.2, "locked_promos": ["A-PROMO3"]}}, "t": 20.6}, {"i": 6, "thought": "兩個平台對帳單都通過、限制也設好了，現在用 analyze 取得每個品項、活動、廣告、退款的實拿數字。", "tool": "analyze", "args": {}, "result": {"totals": {"sales": 468455, "payout": 280849, "commission": 145266, "merchant_discount": 37950, "refunds": 4390, "ad_spend": 6898, "var_cost": 252014, "actual_contribution": 21937, "contribution_now": 21446, "contribution_next": 14381, "rate_change_impact": -7065, "direct_contribution": 235911, "direct_sales": 481125, "orders": 2390, "by_platform_next": {"A": 8983, "B": 12296}, "aov": {"A": 187, "B": 212}}, "problem_items": [{"platform": "A", "item": "排骨便當", "price": 110.0, "dine": 110.0, "qty": 136, "sales": 14960, "unit_now": -0.6, "unit_next": -3.5, "month_next": -874, "status": "loss"}, {"platform": "A", "item": "雞腿便當", "price": 125.0, "dine": 125.0, "qty": 532, "sales": 66500, "unit_now": 0.3, "unit_next": -3.0, "month_next": -3771, "status": "loss"}, {"platform": "A", "item": "魚排便當", "price": 100.0, "dine": 100.0, "qty": 314, "sales": 31400, "unit_now": -0.2, "unit_next": -2.8, "month_next": -8090, "status": "loss"}, {"platform": "A", "item": "雙主菜便當", "price": 150.0, "dine": 150.0, "qty": 277, "sales": 41550, "unit_now": 0.7, "unit_next": -3.2, "month_next": -1984, "status": "loss"}], "ok_item_count": 20, "top_revenue_items": [{"platform": "A", "item": "雞腿便當", "sales": 66500, "unit_next": -3.0, "status": "loss"}, {"platform": "A", "item": "素食便當", "sales": 43365, "unit_next": 21.4, "status": "ok"}, {"platform": "A", "item": "雙主菜便當", "sales": 41550, "unit_next": -3.2, "status": "loss"}, {"platform": "B", "item": "雞腿便當", "sales": 40455, "unit_next": 16.5, "status": "ok"}, {"platform": "A", "item": "魚排便當", "sales": 31400, "unit_next": -2.8, "status": "loss"}], "promos": [{"key": "A-PROMO1", "platform": "A", "name": "魚排便當 買一送一", "orders": 97, "merchant_discount": 9700, "contribution": -6315, "per_order": -65.1, "status": "loss"}, {"key": "A-PROMO2", "platform": "A", "name": "古早味紅茶 8 折", "orders": 284, "merchant_discount": 1610, "contribution": 4868, "per_order": 17.1, "status": "ok"}, {"key": "A-PROMO3", "platform": "A", "name": "滿 199 折 40（店家全額負擔）", "orders": 278, "merchant_discount": 11120, "contribution": -636, "per_order": -2.3, "status": "loss"}, {"key": "B-PROMO1", "platform": "B", "name": "滿 199 折 40（店家全額負擔）", "orders": 388, "merchant_discount": 15520, "contribution": 801, "per_order": 2.1, "status": "ok"}], "ads": [{"key": "A-AD1", "platform": "A", "spend": 1179, "orders": 392, "sales": 72520, "contribution": 4229, "net_if_all_incremental": 3050, "status": "ok"}, {"key": "A-AD2", "platform": "A", "spend": 415, "orders": 225, "sales": 40095, "contribution": 2273, "net_if_all_incremental": 1858, "status": "ok"}, {"key": "B-AD1", "platform": "B", "spend": 5304, "orders": 150, "sales": 31730, "contribution": 3735, "net_if_all_incremental": -1569, "status": "loss"}], "refunds": [{"key": "味噌湯", "item": "味噌湯", "refund_orders": 88, "orders_with_item": 554, "rate": 0.1588, "amount": 2790, "status": "hot"}, {"key": "魚排便當", "item": "魚排便當", "refund_orders": 2, "orders_with_item": 292, "rate": 0.0068, "amount": 400, "status": "ok"}, {"key": "雞腿便當", "item": "雞腿便當", "refund_orders": 4, "orders_with_item": 673, "rate": 0.0059, "amount": 560, "status": "ok"}], "legend": "unit_next＝新費率下每賣一份實拿幾元；status: loss＝賠錢, thin＝幾乎沒賺；ads 的 loss＝就算帶來的單全算廣告功勞也不划算, doubt＝若一半的單本來就會來則不划算"}, "t": 23.6}, {"i": 7, "thought": "分析顯示有幾個賠錢品項，先對 A 平台的排骨便當、雞腿便當、魚排便當、雙主菜便當看各種售價試算，再決定調價。", "tool": "price_options", "args": {"targets": [["A", "排骨便當"], ["A", "雞腿便當"], ["A", "魚排便當"], ["A", "雙主菜便當"]]}, "result": {"options": [{"platform": "A", "item": "排骨便當", "current_price": 110.0, "max_allowed_price": 130, "can_delist": true, "options": [{"price": 115.0, "unit_after": -0.3, "est_month_delta": 456}, {"price": 120.0, "unit_after": 2.8, "est_month_delta": 853}, {"price": 125.0, "unit_after": 6.0, "est_month_delta": 1191}, {"price": 130.0, "unit_after": 9.2, "est_month_delta": 1470}], "delist_est_month_delta": 554}, {"platform": "A", "item": "雞腿便當", "current_price": 125.0, "max_allowed_price": 135, "can_delist": false, "options": [{"price": 130.0, "unit_after": 0.2, "est_month_delta": 1771}, {"price": 135.0, "unit_after": 3.3, "est_month_delta": 3342}], "delist_est_month_delta": 6438}, {"platform": "A", "item": "魚排便當", "current_price": 100.0, "max_allowed_price": 120, "can_delist": true, "options": [{"price": 105.0, "unit_after": 0.4, "est_month_delta": 1204}, {"price": 110.0, "unit_after": 3.5, "est_month_delta": 2304}, {"price": 115.0, "unit_after": 6.7, "est_month_delta": 3301}, {"price": 120.0, "unit_after": 9.8, "est_month_delta": 4194}], "delist_est_month_delta": 7211}, {"platform": "A", "item": "雙主菜便當", "current_price": 150.0, "max_allowed_price": 180, "can_delist": true, "options": [{"price": 155.0, "unit_after": -0.0, "est_month_delta": 915}, {"price": 160.0, "unit_after": 3.1, "est_month_delta": 1743}, {"price": 165.0, "unit_after": 6.3, "est_month_delta": 2484}, {"price": 170.0, "unit_after": 9.4, "est_month_delta": 3138}, {"price": 175.0, "unit_after": 12.6, "est_month_delta": 3705}, {"price": 180.0, "unit_after": 15.8, "est_month_delta": 4186}], "delist_est_month_delta": 1244}], "note": "est_month_delta＝預估每月多留下幾元（假設售價每漲 1% 銷量掉 1.5%）"}, "t": 27.2}, {"i": 8, "thought": "先把有問題的地方一次試算：四個賠錢品項調價（雞腿只漲 10 元）、結束賠錢的買一送一活動、停掉賠錢的 B 廣告、味噌湯換防漏包材。A-PROMO3 不能動，保留。", "tool": "simulate", "args": {"actions": [{"type": "set_price", "platform": "A", "item": "排骨便當", "price": 125}, {"type": "set_price", "platform": "A", "item": "雞腿便當", "price": 135}, {"type": "set_price", "platform": "A", "item": "魚排便當", "price": 110}, {"type": "set_price", "platform": "A", "item": "雙主菜便當", "price": 160}, {"type": "end_promo", "platform": "A", "promo_id": "A-PROMO1"}, {"type": "stop_ad", "pla